{
  "info": {
    "name": "PitIQ — Sprint 4 API Collection",
    "description": "Complete API collection for the PitIQ quiz platform. Covers auth, quizzes, questions (MCQ, TRUE_FALSE, SHORT_TEXT, ESSAY), attempts, scoring, analytics (including essay grading), notifications, integrity, and student endpoints.\n\n**Base URL:** http://localhost:3002/api\n\n## Question types\n| Type | Create (admin) | Save answer (student) | Auto-scored on submit |\n|------|----------------|----------------------|------------------------|\n| MCQ | options + correctAnswer | selectedOptionId | Yes |\n| TRUE_FALSE | options [True, False] | selectedOptionId | Yes |\n| SHORT_TEXT | correctAnswer required | textAnswer | Yes (trim + case-insensitive) |\n| ESSAY | correctAnswer optional | textAnswer | No — admin grades via Analytics → Essay Grading |\n\nWhile essays are pending, `result.gradingStatus` is `PARTIAL` and `result.passed` is `null`.\n\n## Auth Setup\n1. Send `POST /auth/login` with admin or student credentials\n2. Token is auto-saved to `{{token}}` on Login requests\n3. Set `{{quizId}}`, `{{attemptId}}`, `{{questionId}}`, `{{answerId}}` as you run the flow\n\n## Seeded accounts (Password123!)\n- admin1@example.com — admin grading queue on new-quiz-5\n- student1@example.com — student flow + pre-seeded PARTIAL attempt on new-quiz-5\n- student2@example.com — alternate student / invitation tests\n- admin@live-test.example / student@live-test.example — live-test fixtures",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3002/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "adminEmail",
      "value": "admin@live-test.example"
    },
    {
      "key": "adminPassword",
      "value": "Password123!"
    },
    {
      "key": "studentEmail",
      "value": "student@live-test.example"
    },
    {
      "key": "studentPassword",
      "value": "Password123!"
    },
    {
      "key": "quizId",
      "value": "invite-quiz-1"
    },
    {
      "key": "attemptId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "questionId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "questionIdShortText",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "questionIdEssay",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Authentication endpoints — register, login, verify email, resend verification.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "var data = JSON.parse(responseBody);",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('token', data.tokens.accessToken);",
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.test('Has access token', () => pm.expect(data.tokens.accessToken).to.be.a('string'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Demo123!\",\n  \"name\": \"Demo User\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify Email",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"<verification-token>\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Resend Verification",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-verification",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Quizzes (Admin)",
      "description": "Admin quiz CRUD — create, list, get, update, delete, publish/unpublish.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Quizzes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/quizzes",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Quiz",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/quizzes/{{quizId}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Quiz",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/quizzes",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"New Demo Quiz\",\n  \"description\": \"Created via Postman\",\n  \"durationMinutes\": 30,\n  \"passingScore\": 60\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Quiz",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/quizzes/{{quizId}}",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Updated Quiz Title\"\n}"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Publish Quiz",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/quizzes/{{quizId}}/publish",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Unpublish Quiz",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/quizzes/{{quizId}}/unpublish",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Quiz",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/admin/quizzes/{{quizId}}",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Questions",
